e them  and turn them back to their normal  size whenever he wants as a result of  this attack  midnight is knocked down to the ground  and her attempt to put machia to sleep  flops and flops hard midnight  is disappointed in herself but she knows  that there is no time to waste and that  she has to come up with some other plan  she briefly thinks about which quirk  could be strong enough to stop machia  and in the end she decides to contact  momo and so  midnight tells momo that even though it  is against the law  momo must use her quirk creation to make  a powerful  sleeping agent i'm thinking that this is  going to be some sort of military grade  substance that will be strong enough to  put down  even the gigantic machia as the  liberation front members who are  following gigantomachia catch up to an  injured midnight  she puts her faith in momo she tells  momo to make the sleeping agent  give it to one of the pro heroes and  then take the other students and  evacuate  immediately and that is the last that we  hear of midnight  because the villains have arrived and  the connection between momo and midnight  is severed momo is now under a lot of  pressure as a result of this situation  she doesn't know what to do midnight  trusted her to use her own judgment  but she doesn't know if she should just  run away in order to keep all the other  students safe  or stand and fight even though that  would mean putting her life and the  lives of all of the other students  at risk ultimately momo decides that  they can't just run away with their  tails between their legs  and she tells jiro to use earphone jack  to determine how long they have  before machia arrives momo also tells  mudman  and the other students to get ready  because makia is about to arrive  and they need to work together in order  to find a way to stop him  jiro then warns everyone that  gigantomachia is approaching extremely  quickly  she doesn't even need to use her quirk  because she can see makia  and he will arrive in less than 10  seconds in this moment the situation  appears to be hopeless  10 seconds isn't nearly enough time for  the students to come up with a real  strategy  but then out of nowhere mount lady is  able to recover from her  earlier fall and with the help of  kamui's quirk she grabs hold of machia's  leg  this slows down makia but only slightly  he is still moving only now he is forced  to also drag  mount lady along with him as he moves as  all of this is happening momo is already  using creation to produce  canisters of that sleeping agent that  the students will try to use to stop  machia she hands the canisters out to  the other students  as they all vow to stand their ground  and defend their honor  as heroes they might still be students  but they are also on a hero mission  they are wearing their hero costumes and  they have to live up to their hero  values and principles even in the face  of  imminent danger and that is how this  chapter ends  with all the students preparing to face  off against one of the strongest  villains in the history of mha  and as strong as machia is he isn't even  the only threat  that is approaching riding on his back  are a bunch of other  overpowered villains including toga and  dobby and yet  more villains are following on foot so  if the students engage in a battle  against machia and it appears that they  will  they will also have to be battling all  the other villains  i have to say i am truly proud of momo  and the other students for how they  acted  in this insane and stressful moment and  i'm really rooting for all of them  but at the same time i'm extremely  worried for their safety  these are not just some minor characters  that we are talking about here  we have a bunch of class 1a students  here  characters that we have grown to love  since the very beginning  of the story including of course momo  but also  jiro kirishima mina kaminari ojiro sato  and the true protagonist of the entire  series mi