dobby toga and mr compress  spinner and skeptic are also there on  top of  machia in fact gigantomachia was the one  who placed the villains on his back  before leaving the mansion  as per shigaraki's orders skeptic  actually wants to be put  down so he can stay and protect redestro  but  dabi explains that shigaraki must have  awakened ahead of schedule  and machia is only following his  master's orders  giganto machia is completely focused on  carrying out these orders  and he is determined to get to jakku no  matter how many heroes try to stand in  his way  now that i think about it machia is  actually a pretty big  simp for his master but that's neither  here nor there  the heroes at and around the mansion are  surprised to see that makia is awake  prior to the beginning of the raid they  were all assured that this  so-called walking disaster wouldn't  become an issue  and that's because he doesn't move  unless he receives direct orders from  all for one or shigaraki since all for  one isn't tartarus and shigaraki was  unconscious  when the raids began the heroes assumed  that makia would just remain  motionless however something clearly  went wrong in jakku  because makia just became the major  threat for all the heroes  at the mansion these heroes are now  doing their best to help mount lady  whose strength is giving out but  machia's skin  is too thick for any of their attacks to  pierce through  his back looks like a jagged cliff and  trying to take him down is like trying  to  take down a mountain but even though  gigantomachia is now the biggest threat  to the heroes  he is definitely not the only one ice  boy getting is still on the battlefield  and he is facing off against cementos  i always love seeing cementos when he  loses his cool  and in this particular moment samantos  is going all out and screaming at  getting  even the veins on his head are popping  out it's pretty crazy i'll say this much  about cementos  he definitely turned out to be a lot  more badass than we were led to believe  when the story first started at first i  saw him as just this  calm and harmless teacher but when he  gets excited  cementos is not someone you want to mess  with at the same time as samantos is  fighting getting  headshot is going head-to-head against  redestro  and it seems that redestro has been able  to get his legs back  although i'm not sure exactly how he did  it nevertheless  he is now able to use his super move  again the one that turns him into a  stressed out  dark hulk reed destro has also realized  that shigaraki must have awakened early  and he instructs all of the liberation  army soldiers to  follow behind gigantomachia redestro  proclaims that this  is the beginning of their revolution and  all the villains get pumped up by this  and they rush after makia meanwhile  kamui woods is carrying midnight on his  back and they are attempting to get  closer to makia's face  since physical attacks don't work  against machia because his body  is so impenetrable midnight wants to  neutralize him using her sleeping  gas quirk calmly at midnight arrive just  as machia  overpowers mount lady and takes off  running  kamui is of course concerned about mount  lady  but midnight tells him that they can't  lose focus  they have to get as close to makia's  face as possible and put  him to sleep if they can't stop makia  from getting to jakku  that entire city will be faced with a  disaster of  epic proportions at his current size  makia will level the whole city in a  matter of minutes  and he will surely annihilate everything  else that stands  in his path unfortunately for kamui at  midnight  as they get closer to makia's face they  finally realize that other villains  are riding on top of his back compress  uses his quirk to throw a bunch of  marbles at the heroes  which then turn into large boulders  while in mid-air  compress of course has the ability to  shrink large objects and even people  in these marbles and then release them  and turn them back to their normal  size whenever he wants as a result of  this attack  midnight is knocked down to the ground  and her attempt to put machia to sleep  flops and flops hard midnight  is disappointed in herself but she knows  that there is no time to waste and that  she has to come up with some other plan  she briefly thinks about which quirk  could be strong enough to stop machia  and in the end she decides to contact  momo and so  midnight tells momo that even though it  is against the law  momo must use her quirk creation to make  a powerful  sleeping agent i'm thinking that this is  going to be some sort of military grade  substance that will be strong enough to  put down  even the gigantic machia as the  liberation front members who are  following gigantomachia catch up to an  injured midnight  she puts her faith in momo she tells  momo to make the sleeping agent  give it to one of the pro heroes and  then take the other students and  evacuate  immediately and that is the last that we  hear of midnight  because the villains have arrived and  the connection between momo and midnight  is severed momo is now under a lot of  pressure as a result of this situation  she doesn't know what to do midnight  trusted her to use her own judgment  but she doesn't know if she should just  run away in order to keep all the other  students safe  or stand and fight even though that  would mean putting her life and the  lives of all of the other students  at risk ultimately momo decides that  they can't just run away with their  tails between their legs  and she tells jiro to use earphone jack  to determine how long they have  before machia arrives momo also tells  mudman  and the other students to get ready  because makia is about to arrive  and they need to work together in order  to find a way to stop him  jiro then warns everyone that  gigantomachia is approaching extremely  quickly  she doesn't even need to use her quirk  because she can see makia  and he will arrive in less than 10  seconds in this moment the situation  appears to be hopeless  10 seconds isn't nearly enough time for  the students to come up with a real  strategy  but then out of nowhere mount lady is  able to recover from her  earlier fall and with the help of  kamui's quirk she grabs hold of machia's  leg  this slows down makia but only slightly  he is still moving only now he is forced  to also drag  mount lady along with him as he moves as  all of this is happening momo is already  using creation to produce  canisters of that sleeping agent that  the students will try to use to stop  machia she hands the canisters out to  the other students  as they all vow to stand their ground  and defend their honor  as heroes they might still be students  but they are also on a hero mission  they are wearing their hero costumes and  they have to live up to their hero  values and principles even in the face  of  imminent danger and that is how this  chapter ends  with all the students preparing to face  off against one of the strongest  villains in the history of mha  and as strong as machia is he isn't even  the only threat  that is approaching riding on his back  are a bunch of other  overpowered villains including toga and  dobby and yet  more villains are following on foot so  if the students engage in a battle  against machia and it appears that they  will  they will also have to be battling all  the other villains  i have to say i am truly proud of momo  and the other students for how they  acted  in this insane and stressful moment and  i'm really rooting for all of them  but at the same time i'm extremely  worried for their safety  these are not just some minor characters  that we are talking about here  we have a bunch of class 1a students  here  characters that we have grown to love  since the very beginning  of the story including of course momo  but also  jiro kirishima mina kaminari ojiro sato  and the true protagonist of the entire  series mino rominita  not to mention the class 1b students who  are here as well including juzo and  tatsutetsu  the lives of every single one of these  students is now  in direct danger and it is possible that  some of them will die  within the next few chapters i think  that if they can come up with a good  team strategy these students will  definitely be a formidable force  but at the end of the day they are not  facing off against a few minor  or even mid-level villains they are  about to face off against  a walking mountain and some of the  strongest villains in the story  including dobby it's really hard for me  to believe that villains the likes of  makia and dabi  won't succeed in reaching jakku their  presence there is practically required  for a fully satisfying final showdown  with endeavour fighting shigaraki now  has to be the time that horikoshi  finally plans to have that fateful  encounter between  ng and dobby so while i look forward to  seeing what kind of strategy the  students will come up with and while i  wish them the best of luck  i don't think that they will succeed in  stopping the villains all together  although they might slow them down or  potentially stop some of them from  continuing the trip to jakku  i mean think about it if all of these  experienced pro heroes like  cementos headshot mount lady and fat gum  couldn't stop gigantomachia is it really  fair to expect the students to stop him  except for a few exceptions like  kaminari and tokoyami these students  were never even supposed to see  any direct action they were never  supposed to be on the front lines  and yet now they find themselves facing  off against some of the strongest  villains to ever appear  in the boku no hero world and not only  is gigantomachia strong  but he is also fanatically obsessed with  carrying out his master's orders  and he will do literally anything to get  where he needs to go  even if that means killing everyone in  his path  i really don't know how to feel 